-- title:
--   Fifteen-branch Syracuse descent after the escape-density and period restrictions
-- statement:
--   Keep all assumptions of the residual after the distinct segment budget. On every injective positive-time suffix impose the logarithmic-density-zero condition for small valuation deficits. For every positive return from a positive-time state impose the period and valuation coordinates of the certified nontrivial-period sieve. Prove descent below the original starting value.
-- source:
